1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,379
Meet Unpause, created by Shivam Gupta.

2
00:00:04,093 --> 00:00:05,453
Leave yourself a way back.

3
00:00:05,792 --> 00:00:08,152
You have ten free minutes, but the next

4
00:00:08,152 --> 00:00:10,592
step is unclear and the materials have moved.

5
00:00:11,352 --> 00:00:13,232
Unpause keeps the context you need together.

6
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:20,492
Before stopping, leave yourself a handoff:

7
00:00:20,872 --> 00:00:23,392
what you finished, one small next action, and

8
00:00:23,392 --> 00:00:24,332
where the pieces live.

9
00:00:24,952 --> 00:00:27,192
Here, a new checkpoint gives the next session

10
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:28,832
a clear place to begin.

11
00:00:33,792 --> 00:00:35,312
Add a photo when it helps.

12
00:00:35,892 --> 00:00:38,152
Your notes and photos stay on your device.

13
00:00:40,792 --> 00:00:43,712
Each return becomes part of the project's story.

14
00:00:44,372 --> 00:00:47,192
You can revisit earlier notes, keep making, or

15
00:00:47,192 --> 00:00:48,032
finish the project.

16
00:00:48,472 --> 00:00:50,612
The goal is to make the next beginning

17
00:00:50,612 --> 00:00:51,152
easier.

18
00:00:54,792 --> 00:00:57,192
Choose the time and energy you have.

19
00:00:57,992 --> 00:00:59,792
Find a project with a step that fits.

20
00:01:00,792 --> 00:01:02,872
Three unfinished projects are free.

21
00:01:03,432 --> 00:01:06,192
Studio is the planned lifetime upgrade through RevenueCat.

22
00:01:06,952 --> 00:01:09,212
Live purchases and store release are still pending.

23
00:01:09,992 --> 00:01:12,732
Backups stay free, and your memories remain yours.

24
00:01:13,372 --> 00:01:13,832
Unpause.

25
00:01:14,432 --> 00:01:15,432
Leave yourself a way back.
